category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Portable, open-source, coherent noise-generating library for C++ (runtime)"
ldesc: "libnoise is a portable C++ library that is used to generate coherent noise, a
type of smoothly-changing noise. libnoise can generate Perlin noise, ridged
multifractal noise, and other types of coherent-noise."
external-source: libnoise

